nits", "label": "Money as integer minor units (amount, currency, scale)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ruangkpr-docs/04-MOCK-API-JSON-CONTRACT.md", "source_location": "L157", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Integers avoid binary float errors; IDR keeps scale 2 for cross-currency consistency; UI formats from typed values, never display strings."}, {"id": "ruangkpr_docs_04_mock_api_json_contract_rate_bps", "label": "Rate and ratio in basis points (value_bps, is_estimate)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ruangkpr-docs/04-MOCK-API-JSON-CONTRACT.md", "source_location": "L171", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Logic uses value_bps (DTI 3833 = 38.33%, LTV 4882 = 48.82%); display_percent is convenience only; is_estimate required on numbers that could be mistaken for official values."}, {"id": "ruangkpr_docs_04_mock_api_json_contract_version_concurrency", "label": "Optimistic concurrency (version / expected_version -> CONFLICT_VERSION)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ruangkpr-docs/04-MOCK-API-JSON-CONTRACT.md", "source_location": "L192", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "ruangkpr_docs_04_mock_api_json_contract_idempotency_key", "label": "Idempotency-Key (create, submit, activate, mark-paid, simulation apply)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ruangkpr-docs/04-MOCK-API-JSON-CONTRACT.md", "source_location": "L274", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "ruangkpr_docs_04_mock_api_json_contract_error_catalog", "label": "Error catalog (VALIDATION_FAILED, OFFICIAL_OUTSTANDING_REQUIRED, AMORTIZATION_UNAVAILABLE, ...)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ruangkpr-docs/04-MOCK-API-JSON-CONTRACT.md", "source_location": "L282", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "ruangkpr_docs_0